  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthen SRHR in Niger and Mali</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to strengthen access to sexual and reproductive health services and education, and promote the abandonment of gender-based violence (GBV) for adolescents, young girls and boys and women and men in Mali and Niger. In addition, for Mali, the project will contribute to the reduction of Female Genital Mutilation (FGM).</narrative>
  </description>
